mode.description:
Which strategy to run. `solar` follows live surplus once the home battery is full;
`forecasted` lets today's forecast decide how much of the sun the car may have;
`fastNoBattery` charges flat out from PV and grid with the home battery held out of it, and
ends itself when the car is full; `targeted` delivers a stated amount by a stated time and
needs `target`. `off` is not a mode to start — use the stop endpoint.
